        <activityName xml:lang="en">Treatment, sewage grass refinery, to wastewater treatment, class 3</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Treatment, sewage grass refinery, to wastewater treatment, class 3
Wastewater purified in a medium size municipal wastewater treatment plant (capacity class 3), with an average capacity size of 24900 per-captia-equivalents PCE. \nWastewater contains (in kg/m3): TOC: 25.4 (GSD=122.5%);
UUID: a475e344-90b0-403a-a78a-f8f1c748c36f
Infrastructure materials for municipal wastewater treatment plant, transports, dismantling. Land use burdens.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Three stage wastewater treatment (mechanical, biological, chemical) including sludge digestion (fermentation) according to the average technology in Switzerland
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: wastewater compositions from literature and/or estimates
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a475e344-90b0-403a-a78a-f8f1c748c36f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
